      "writtenOn": "2020-04-09T13:58:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because that is a directory not a zip file. The .srcjar containing the stubs .java files isn\u0027t copied into the snapshot zip it is merged with it. So, if the .srcjar contains foo/bar/Baz.java and it is merged into the above directory then when the snapshot zip is unpackaged it will be placed in \"sdk_library/public/myjavalib_stub_sources/foo/bar/Baz.java\".\n\nThe intent was to store the source files as text files (rather than wrapped in a binary zip) so that they would be easier for git to handle and, more importantly, will allow gerrit to show the actual differences rather than just reporting \"binary file changed\".",
